1 +x2+y2; (34)
wherea,b,k, andpare parameters. It can be seen that both components of the map function
contain an innite number of power series terms, rendering inapplicable sparse optimization
for nding the system equations from data.
15In the mathematical formulation of compressive sensing Eq. (1), a requirement is that the
projection matrix Gbe random, e.g., Gaussian type of random matrices with no correlations
